:: Mine Job Minecarts Intro
<<effects>>

The <<person>> grabs a chain and attaches one end to your shackles and the other to the rail. "Move rocks along the tunnel and dump them in the designated areas," <<he>> barks. "Get to work, we'll be watching you."
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts
<<effects>>

You're in a tunnel. The sounds of pickaxes hitting rocks surround you.
<<if $exposed gte 1>>
	The guards openly stare at your <<lewdness>>.
<</if>>
<<if isPregnancyEnding()>>
	<<generate1>>
	You clutch your stomach and go to your knees. A <<person1>><<person>> notices you. <<He>> rushes to your side, removing your chains. You slip out of consciousness as <<he>> lifts you.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Birth]]>><</link>>
<<elseif $stress gte $stressmax>>
	You've pushed yourself too much.
	<br><br>

	<<passout>>
	<<link [[Everything fades to black...|Mine Job Minecarts Passout]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<elseif Time.hour lte 5 or Time.hour gte 21>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts End]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Focus on moving rocks (1:00)|Mine Job Minecarts Event]]>><<pass 1 hours>><<set $phase to 0>><<tiredness 3>><<physique 3>><</link>><<gtiredness>><<gphysique>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Pretend to move rocks (1:00)|Mine Job Minecarts Event]]>><<pass 1 hours>><<set $phase to 1>><<stress 3>><</link>><<gstress>>
	<<if $mine.favor.minecarts is 1>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Ask for a distraction|Mine Job Minecarts Distraction]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
	<<if $mine.favor.job.night is "note" and !$mine.favor.night>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Search for the person|Mine Job Minecarts Note]]>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Event
<<effects>>
<<if $phase is 0>>
	You focus on actually doing the work.
	<<print either(
		"You try to move a cart, but it's really heavy. You manage to push it and dump it, but your muscles ache and your heart pumps wildly. <<tiredness 15>><<ggtiredness>><<pain 5>><<ggpain>>",
		"You grab a cart and push it. The wheel keeps getting stuck on the track.",
		"While pushing a cart, you reach an incline. It takes more effort to get it up. <<tiredness 5>><<gtiredness>>",
		"You find a cart that's mostly empty.",
		"You grab a cart and push it. The wheel keeps making an annoying squeaking noise.",
		"You make your way through an unlit section of tunnels."
	)>>
<<else>>
	You push around empty minecarts. You hope the guards don't notice.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<cleareventpool>>

<<addinlineevent "nothing" 1.5>>
	You go on without interruption.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "scream" 1.5>>
	You hear a scream echo through the tunnels. <<stress 10>><<trauma 5>><<ggstress>><<gtrauma>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "explosion" 1.5>>
	The rumbling of a distant explosion threatens to send you to the ground, but you manage to keep your footing. <<stress 10>><<ggstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if $mine.favor.minecarts isnot 1 and $mine.distraction.minecarts is undefined>>
	<<addinlineevent "clothes">>
		<<generatey1>><<person1>>
		You see a <<person>>, <span class="blue"><<hes>> nude.</span> <<He>> tries to cover <<himself>>, unsuccessfully.
		<br><br>
		<<if $exposed is 0 and hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
			<<link [[Give <<him>> your clothes|Mine Job Minecarts Clothes]]>><<set $mine.favor.minecarts to 1>><</link>><<exhibitionist3>>
			<br>
		<</if>>
		<<link [[Ignore <<him>>|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "rock">>
	<<generate1>><<generate2>>
	As you push your cart into a large cave, you notice an unshackled <<person1>><<person>> running away from a <<person2>><<person>>. The guard catches up to <<person1>><<him>> and tackles <<him>> to the ground. The <<person2>><<person>> stands up and starts beating the <<person1>><<person>> with <<person2>><<his>> baton.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Throw a rock at the guard|Mine Job Minecarts Rock]]>><<mine_hope 1>><</link>><<ghope>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Ignore|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><<mine_hope -1>><</link>><<lhope>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<if $mine.setup.weapons isnot 1>>
	<<addinlineevent "weapons" 0.5>>
		<<generate1>><<generate2>>
		You overhear two guards talking. You get closer. "Why are these still out here?!" a <<person1>><<person>> yells. "Well I–" a <<person2>><<person>> stammers.
		<br><br>
		"Never mind, I don't care, just put them somewhere safe so the trash doesn't get their grubby mitts on them!" the <<person1>><<person>> yells. "I'll get some slaves to help–" the <<person2>><<person>> says quietly.
		<br><br>
		"No! You will do it!" the <<person1>><<person>> shouts. "But–" the <<person2>><<person>> stammers. "Just finish it you idiot!" the <<person1>><<person>> screams as <<he>> walks away.
		<br><br>
		"Just finish it you idiot," the <<person2>><<person>> says mockingly. "Ungrateful cretin." <<He>> notices you listening, "You heard <<person1>><<him>>, just finish it." <<person2>><<He>> points to a black crate. "Put it in there." <<He>> gestures towards a small cave.
		<br><br>
		You lift the crate. It's pretty heavy. You set the crate down in the cave.
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Open the crate|Mine Job Minecarts Weapons]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Just leave|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</if>>

<<addinlineevent "dust">>
	<<generate1>><<generate2>><<generate3>><<generate4>>
	As you're pushing a cart though a large cave, you hear whistles and jeers from a group of guards. You ignore them and hastily continue on, not wanting anything bad to happen. <<stress 10>><<ggstress>><<trauma 10>><<ggtrauma>> 
	<br><br>
	<<if $rng gte 51>>
		You soon reach an elevated section of track and pass by a large pile of dust. <span class="blue">You realize the guards are standing right below it.</span>
		<br><br>
		<<link [[Knock the pile off|Mine Job Minecarts Dust]]>><</link>>
		<br>
		<<link [[Ignore it|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<</if>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "bomb">>
	As you're pushing a cart through a large cave, you hear a commotion and a guard racing away from one side of the cave to cover. You notice several red objects attached to the cave wall, <span class="red">they're bombs!</span> You dive behind the cart and brace yourself as a loud explosion blows out your eardrums. <<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
	<br><br>
	Your ears ring while you find your bearings, your hand touches something hot. You look at it, 
	<<if $science gte 100>>
		<<if !$mine.bomb.progress>>
			<<set $mine.bomb.progress to 0>>
		<</if>>
		<<set $mine.bomb.parts++>>
		<span class="green">it's a part of a bomb!</span> You wait for it to cool down and take it with you. | <span class="green">Bomb Part Added</span>
	<<else>>
		<span class="blue">it's a small bit of metal and other things you don't recognise.</span>
	<</if>>
	<br><br>
	You sit around the cart and make sure you're out of sight as your hearing comes back.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<addinlineevent "control">>
	You take a break from pushing a cart to wipe the sweat from your brow and catch your breath. You turn to resume your work only to see <span class="red">the cart going along the track on its own!</span>
	<br><br>
	You start to chase after it, but it's moving pretty fast at this point. 
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Climb in|Mine Job Minecarts Climb]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 20 40>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stop it|Mine Job Minecarts Stop]]>><</link>><<physiquedifficulty 12000 15000>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Let it go|Mine Job Minecarts Lost]]>><<set $phase to 0>><</link>>
<</addinlineevent>>

<<runeventpool>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts End
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>

A <<person1>><<person>> walks up to you. "Day's over," <<he>> says. <<He>> grabs you and disconnects you from the rail. <<He>> quickly pushes you into a group of slaves.
<br><br>
You walk with them until you reach a metal gate leading to a small cave. The group filters through the gate, and when everyone is inside, the guard slams the gate shut.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Night]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Distraction
<<effects>>
<<loadNPC 0 "mine_minecarts">>

You make your way to the <<person1>><<person>>.
<br><br>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"Can you distract the guards for me?" you ask.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"I need you to distract the guards," you say.
<<else>>
	"I want you to distract the guards," you say.
<</if>>
Fear washes over <<his>> face. <<He>> opens <<his>> mouth to speak but looks down at <<his>> legs.
<br><br>
"When do you want it done?" <<he>> reluctantly asks.
<br><br>
<<mine_distract_links "Mine Job Minecarts Distraction Set">>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Distraction Set
<<effects>>

<<if $phase isnot "no">>
	<<set $mine.distraction.minecarts to $phase>><<unset $mine.favor.minecarts>>

	You tell <<him>> you want the distraction to happen <<mine_distract_time>>.
	<br><br>
	<<He>> nods and returns to <<his>> work.
	<<clearNPC "mine_minecarts">>
<<else>>
	You tell <<him>> you changed your mind, <<he>> nods before returning to work.
<</if>>

<<endevent>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Clothes
<<effects>><<upperstrip>><<lowerstrip>><<saveNPC 0 "mine_minecarts">>

You remove your clothes and toss them to <<him>>. <<He>> looks at you in shock. "Thank you," <<he>> mumbles and slips the clothes on.
<br><br>
<<exhibitionism3>> You keep working, conscious of your <<lewdness>>.
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Rock
<<effects>>

You grab a rock <<if $phase is 0>>from the cart<<else>>off the ground<</if>> and throw it at the guard. <<person2>><<He>> grunts in pain and falls to the ground and the <<person1>><<person>> runs off into the tunnels.
<br><br>
You quickly push your cart into one of the connected tunnels before the guard can get <<person2>><<his>> bearings. <<stress -5>><<lstress>><<trauma -5>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Weapons
<<effects>>

You open the crate to reveal a bunch of guns, each secured with a heavy lock, too heavy to pick.
<br><br>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 100>>
<<link [[Try to sabotage them|Mine Job Minecarts Weapons Sabotage]]>><<skulduggerycheck "silent">><</link>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<br>
<<link [[Close the crate and leave|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Weapons Sabotage
<<effects>>

<<if $skulduggerysuccess>>
	<span class="green">You sabotage each gun. Nobody would be able to tell they didn't work just by looking at them.</span>
	<<set $mine.setup.weapons to 1>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You can't figure out how to disable them without it being obvious.</span>
<</if>>
<br><br>
"What's taking so long?" the <<person2>><<person>> yells from outside.
<br><br>
<<link [[Leave|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Dust
<<effects>><<set $mine.setup.dust to 5>>

You kick as much of the dust onto them as you can until they're almost completely buried. Their arms emerge from the pile. Their faces and upper bodies follow suit. <<stress -3>><<lstress>><<trauma -3>><<ltrauma>>
<br><br>
They start coughing and hacking very loudly. Not wanting to be caught, you make a quick getaway with the cart.
<br><br>
<<link [[Leave|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Lost
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>

<<if $phase is 0>>
	You let the cart go and watch it barrel into the darkness. Not knowing what else to do, you start to make your way back through the tunnel. 
<<elseif $phase is 1>>
	You watch the cart barrel into the darkness. Not knowing what else to do, you stand up and start to make your way back through the tunnel. 
<<else>>
	You look up and see the cart barrel into the darkness. Not knowing what else to do, you stand up and start to make your way back through the tunnel. 
<</if>>
"Where's that cart you had?" a <<person>> asks.
<br><br>
<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
	"I lost it," you say solemnly.
<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
	"Somewhere down there," you say as you point down the tunnel. "Go find it."
<<else>>
	"It got away from me," you say.
<</if>>
<<He>> sighs.
<br><br>
You start to walk away as <<he>> yells, "Don't think you're getting away with that unpunished." <<He>> grabs your neck and disconnects you from the rail before dragging you with <<him>>.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Stop
<<effects>>

You grab onto the side of the cart and dig your feet into the ground.
<<if $physiqueSuccess>>
	<span class="green">The cart slows to a stop,</span> but your feet ache from it. <<pain 10>><<ggpain>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">You quickly lose your grip and fall to the hard ground.</span> <<pain 5>><<gpain>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts Lost]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Climb
<<effects>>

You grab onto the top of the cart and try to climb inside.
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	<span class="green">You manage to pull yourself into it.</span> You grab onto the brake, ready to pull it. <span class="blue">An idea strikes you.</span> You could let the cart continue. If you reach the end of the rail you're attached to, it might break the chain.
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Let it continue|Mine Job Minecarts Cart Free]]>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[Stop it|Mine Job Minecarts Cart Stop]]>><</link>>
<<else>>
	You are unable to pull yourself into the cart before losing grip and tumbling to the ground. <<pain 5>><<gpain>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts Lost]]>><<set $phase to 2>><</link>>
<</if>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Cart Stop
<<effects>>

You pull on the brake and the cart comes to a quick stop. With a heavy exhale, you climb out of the cart and continue as normal.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><<endevent>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Cart Free
<<effects>><<mine_unshackle>>

You let go of the brake and watch as the cart continues to gain speed. You catch a glimpse of the end of the rail keeping you chained. You just barely prepare for it before you're violently pulled out of the cart and onto the hard ground. <<pain 5>><<gpain>>
<br><br>
You look at your feet, <span class="green">the shackles are broken!</span> You scramble to your feet and rush off into the tunnels.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts Escape]]>><</link>>



