<<effects>>
<<generate1>><<generate2>>
<<set $mine.favor.night to 1>>
You feign doing work as you look for the person. You spot a <<person2>><<person>> mining, <span class="blue"><<he>> has a diamond painted on <<his>> boiler suit.</span> As you approach, you notice a <<person1>><<person>> staring at <<person2>><<him>>.<<person1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[Distract <<him>>|Mine Job Minecarts Note Distract]]>><</link>><<promiscuous1>>
<br>
<<link [[Pull <<his>> pants down|Mine Job Minecarts Note Pull]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Note Distract
<<effects>>

You walk up to the <<person1>><<person>> and whisper into <<his>> ear. "You look stressed. You should take a rest." The <<person>> looks at you. While <<he>>'s distracted, you slip the note to the <<person2>><<person>>. The <<person1>><<person>> shoves you off. "Get back to work," <<he>> yells.
<<promiscuity1>>
<<endevent>>
<<link [[Next|Mine Job Minecarts]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Note Pull
<<effects>>

You grab the <<person1>><<person>>'s pants and pull them down, exposing <<him>>. While <<he>>'s fixing them you hand the note to the <<person2>><<person>>. The <<person1>><<person>> looks at you in anger, grabs you by the neck, and disconnects you from the chain before dragging you through the tunnels.
<br><br>
<<link [[Next|Mine Punishment]]>><</link>>



:: Mine Job Minecarts Escape
<<effects>><<generate1>><<person1>>

You run through the tunnels, avoiding patrolling guards. You emerge in a tunnel with groups of slaves mining the walls. Noticing a watching guard, you duck behind a wall. You peek from your cover to make sure <<he>> didn't notice you. You notice a ring of keys on <<his>> belt.
<br><br>
<<link [[Run off into the tunnels|Mine Escape]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Attack the guard|Mine Revolt]]>><</link>>
